Let word be "abcabcbb".
Let n be the number of characters in word.
Let best start at 0.

For every i from 0 to n - 1:
    For every j from i to n - 1:
        Let repeated be false.
        If j is more than i:
            For every k from i to j - 1:
                If character k of word is character j of word:
                    Set repeated to true.
        If repeated is false:
            Let span be j - i + 1.
            If span is more than best:
                Set best to span.

Print best.
